  ('jurisprudence', 'LAW', 'The theory and philosophy of law', 'Analytical jurisprudence asks what law is, not what it should be', 140, 'master'),
  ('stare decisis', 'LAW', 'The doctrine of following established precedent', 'Stare decisis provides stability and predictability in the legal system', 140, 'master'),
